      "internal": false,
      "mergeID": "6000cf318ac92e5eb589ee07",
      "mergedPostDetails": "The Parameter Driver behaviour lets us set parameters to a specified value.\nI think it would be a big benefit to have the behaviour give us 3 options: Set, Add, Subtract.\nThis way we could use the same state(s) over and over to dynamically change a parameter without having a complex layer (with a state for each value desired, it's bound to have issues imo)",
      "mergedPostTitle": "[FEEDBACK] Add or Subtract value for Parameter Driver",
